              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbonye ibara! Kuko mmeze nk’igihe c’iyerūra ry’amatunda yo mu ci, nk’uduhūmbga two mu ruzabibu: ata n’agahando ko kurya; umutima wanje wifuza agasukoni k’isega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
