        {
          "text": "Ragiza abantu bawe inyobozo yawe, ari bo mukuku wawe wīzīziye, bībēra ukwabo mu kibira co hagati kuri Karumeli: barishe i Bashani n’i Gileyadi, nko mu gihe ca kera. ",
